    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TimeLab</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the future of learning and adventure with TimeLab \u2013 your knowledge and experience platform for virtual time travel! Visit historical moments and places with a time travel simulator. Each module\u00a0\u2013 available as a separate DLC\u00a0\u2013 gives you access to a different travel destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/67e0c25631f45d170b7c3f0dfa7e5679.poster.avif?t=1743674969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/67e0c25631f45d170b7c3f0dfa7e5679.webm?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/67e0c25631f45d170b7c3f0dfa7e5679.mp4?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Relive history:</strong> Visit historical events and locations based on thorough research.  At the moment, you can relive the Apollo 11 moon landing and take a trip to Bavarian king Ludwig II's unrealized dream castle Falkenstein.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/adb51de51641a95f386885c2929b5b2a.poster.avif?t=1743674969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/adb51de51641a95f386885c2929b5b2a.webm?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/adb51de51641a95f386885c2929b5b2a.mp4?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Learn about history:</strong> Each data module offers an informative time travel experience, along with a game, a quiz, and a detailed introduction to make learning fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/d78d2ef904ec1b2fadfdddf381249da4.poster.avif?t=1743674969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/d78d2ef904ec1b2fadfdddf381249da4.webm?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/d78d2ef904ec1b2fadfdddf381249da4.mp4?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive VR experience</strong>: Get up close and personal with history, discover details and play themed mini games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/ca9eb6833970dbd723ffd8d3f61754f5.poster.avif?t=1743674969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/ca9eb6833970dbd723ffd8d3f61754f5.webm?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/ca9eb6833970dbd723ffd8d3f61754f5.mp4?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Free Content:</strong> Two data modules are already included \u2013 experience the first manned moon landing and explore Falkenstein, an unrealized castle of King Ludwig II. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TimeLab</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the future of learning and adventure with TimeLab \u2013 your knowledge and experience platform for virtual time travel! Visit historical moments and places with a time travel simulator. Each module\u00a0\u2013 available as a separate DLC\u00a0\u2013 gives you access to a different travel destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/67e0c25631f45d170b7c3f0dfa7e5679.poster.avif?t=1743674969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/67e0c25631f45d170b7c3f0dfa7e5679.webm?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/67e0c25631f45d170b7c3f0dfa7e5679.mp4?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Relive history:</strong> Visit historical events and locations based on thorough research.  At the moment, you can relive the Apollo 11 moon landing and take a trip to Bavarian king Ludwig II's unrealized dream castle Falkenstein.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/adb51de51641a95f386885c2929b5b2a.poster.avif?t=1743674969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/adb51de51641a95f386885c2929b5b2a.webm?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490900/extras/adb51de51641a95f386885c2929b5b2a.mp4?t=1743674969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid